BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 357.97 Tm (supply looks like on screen: a no-ground fault. Live-to-neutral read a correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 342.75 Tm (225, but live-to-earth read 53 when it should have matched, and neutral-to-earth) Tj ET
